<title>USA: Interwest Bancorp Inc Q1 net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>Interwest Bancorp Inc Q1 net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>OAK HARBOR, Wash. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ended</p>
<p>					 Dec. 31, 1996    Dec. 31, 1995</p>
<p> INTEREST INCOME			    33,112	     28,718</p>
<p> INTEREST EXPENSE			   19,069	     16,924</p>
